{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner just moved into a new house, and it turns out there is something really bad going on. All your nightmares become true in a chaotic night, you won't be able to rest much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.poster.avif?t=1757073161\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.webm?t=1757073161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.mp4?t=1757073161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a good couple? You'll need to work together and be in perfect harmony or you won't make it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.poster.avif?t=1757073161\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.webm?t=1757073161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.mp4?t=1757073161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleeping will be crucial to save energy and advance through the night, but you also need to find a key to escape from the house and discover what is beyond the garden gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.poster.avif?t=1757073161\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.webm?t=1757073161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.mp4?t=1757073161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for two players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the network with your friends using Steam Remote Play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone too, but it won't be as fun and you may die quick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil Artificial Intelligence  rules over the house, making every night a different experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238310?t=1757073161","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/39c0af69f981783b16a6422325266d858ddb1d9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757073161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/92467f8f54b961c5d803471c9403f3dc9224149d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757073161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/92467f8f54b961c5d803471c9403f3dc9224149d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757073161","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Sc